00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:21,000
Saving Bikini Bottom: The Sandy Cheeks Movie is a 2024 American adventure comedy film based on the
animated television series SpongeBob SquarePants, created by Stephen Hillenburg.

11
00:39:52,500 --> 00:39:58,500
It was directed by Liza Johnson and written by Tom
Stern and Kaz, based on a story by Kaz.

12
00:43:30,000 --> 00:43:36,000
Combining CGI animation with live-action, the film stars the series' regular voice cast and introduces new characters performed
by Johnny Knoxville, Craig Robinson, Grey DeLisle, Ilia Isorelýs Paulino, Matty Cardarople, and Wanda Sykes.

13
00:47:07,500 --> 00:47:13,500
The plot follows Sandy and SpongeBob as they venture to Sandy's home
state of Texas to save Bikini Bottom from an evil CEO.

14
00:50:45,000 --> 00:50:51,000
It is the first entry in a series of SpongeBob character spin-off films
for Netflix, followed by Plankton: The Movie in 2025.

15
00:54:22,500 --> 00:54:28,500
The film was first conceived during a pitching session for ideas
for The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge on the Run (2020).

16
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
In March 2020, ViacomCBS announced that it would be producing
SpongeBob spin-off films for streaming television.

17
01:01:37,500 --> 01:01:43,500
In May 2021, a spin-off film starring Sandy was
announced, with Johnson, Kaz, and Stern attached.

18
01:05:15,000 --> 01:05:21,000
Moniker composed the original score.

19
01:08:52,500 --> 01:08:58,500
Prior to its release, the film was leaked on January
21, 2024, as a video upload on X.

20
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:36,000
Saving Bikini Bottom: The Sandy Cheeks Movie was
officially released on Netflix on August 2, 2024.

21
01:16:07,500 --> 01:16:13,500
The film debuted with 12.8 million views during its premiere weekend, making it Netflix's
most-watched title of the week and received mixed reviews from critics.

22
01:19:45,000 --> 01:19:51,000
The film explores themes of squirrel, texas, road
trip, save the day, based on tv series.

23
01:23:22,500 --> 01:23:28,500
The tone is lighthearted.
